     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Ah, thank you yes that worked! I see now from your answer that the cause of the problem was that R v4.0.0 changed the default for stringsAsFactors to FALSE, so an alternative that also works is adding stringsAsFactors = TRUE when making the dataframe</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks very much for the help!</div><div><br></div><div>Rowena<br><code></code></div></div>"
    ],
    [
